# CRITICAL CORRECTION
The W44-36 meta-file claim of "+136-139% bytes" on codec_wiki cells is a
SCALE/DOC ERROR. The ledger TSV `bytes_delta_pct` field at the same cells
shows +3.20% (e6 d=4.0) to +7.34% (e7 d=4.0). All five OPEN cells are in
the +3.2-7.3% range, NOT +136%. Verified by direct read of
benchmarks/cjxl_parity_ledger_2026-05-18.tsv at the same rows.

