# Honest-stop note
This memo is investigate-only. The dominant wedge mechanism (B, at e7) is
HYPOTHESIS-level only; H1 has not been verified by measuring cjxl's
number of histograms. The mechanism (A) at e6 d=4.0 is well-understood
(DCT32/DCT64 mispick, same root cause as 1418519 already addressed by
W44-35 try_dct64 hint that evidently doesn't extend to e6). Extending
the W44-35 hint to e6 is straightforward and would close ~1 of the 5
OPEN cells (e6 d=4.0).
